# identities/example/hosts — short labels for your machines, shown in the tmux
# status bar, the terminal tab title and the Claude Code statusline.
#
#   <hostname glob>  <label>  [work]
#
# First match wins; the glob is matched against `hostname -s`. "work" gives a
# machine's sessions a distinct look (an orange label) so you never confuse
# them. Unmatched machines show their hostname.
#
# my-desktop       desk
# my-laptop        lap
# build-box-*      build
# corp-laptop-*    corp     work
